{
  "id": "debrief",
  "start": "debrief.intro",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "debrief.close",
      "speaker": "wren_halden",
      "text": "Chapter closed enough. Orth remains useful until he doesn't. If Maris messages, you will tell me \u2014 not because romance is mission-critical, but because secrets are. Dismissed. Lower-third on the way out.",
      "tags": [
        "exit",
        "debrief",
        "ending",
        "end"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "reception_debrief_complete",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "chapter_the_reception_done",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "ending_reception_complete",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "choices": [],
      "next": null,
      "faculty_interjections": [
        {
          "faculty": "Analysis",
          "text": "Reception complete. Endings diverge; save the flag set.",
          "weight": 1
        },
        {
          "faculty": "Idealism",
          "text": "You were a person for parts of it. Keep those parts.",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "debrief.inter_cold",
      "speaker": "wren_halden",
      "text": "Downstream. What a hideous word for leaving a person in a corner. Professionally tidy. Interpersonally you are a spreadsheet with shoes. Maris will have noticed. I notice. Rubric scored. Go home before I prescribe more smiling.",
      "tags": [
        "debrief"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "debrief_inter_grade",
          "value": "cold"
        },
        {
          "op": "rel",
          "char": "wren_halden",
          "respect": -1
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "debrief.cold.close",
          "text": "Home. No more smiling drills tonight.",
          "intent": "close",
          "next": "debrief.close",
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "next": null,
      "faculty_interjections": [
        {
          "faculty": "Insecurity",
          "text": "Spreadsheet with shoes. Accurate. Unkind. Accurate.",
          "weight": 1
        },
        {
          "faculty": "Empathy",
          "text": "You can still change the next page.",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "debrief.inter_ideal",
      "speaker": "wren_halden",
      "text": "You spent company time on someone else's career. Operationally irritating. Interpersonally... I have no clinical synonym for 'decent' that doesn't sound like a threat. Logged as decent. Don't make a habit without telling me.",
      "tags": [
        "debrief"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "debrief_inter_grade",
          "value": "decent"
        },
        {
          "op": "rel",
          "char": "wren_halden",
          "trust": 1
        },
        {
          "op": "rel",
          "char": "wren_halden",
          "affection": 1
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "debrief.ideal.close",
          "text": "Logged. I'll warn you before the next decency.",
          "intent": "close",
          "next": "debrief.close",
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "next": null,
      "faculty_interjections": [
        {
          "faculty": "Idealism",
          "text": "She said decent. Frame it.",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "debrief.inter_soft",
      "speaker": "wren_halden",
      "text": "Hmm. Perceived authenticity up; operational purity... negotiable. I am not paid to be moved. I am noting, however, that Maris Quell is not an affection meter \u2014 and you finally treated her like that was true. Partial credit. Human-shaped.",
      "tags": [
        "debrief",
        "comedy"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "debrief_inter_grade",
          "value": "human_shaped"
        },
        {
          "op": "rel",
          "char": "wren_halden",
          "respect": 1
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "debrief.soft.close",
          "text": "I'll take human-shaped.",
          "intent": "close",
          "next": "debrief.close",
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "next": null,
      "faculty_interjections": [
        {
          "faculty": "Composure",
          "text": "Partial credit from Wren is a parade.",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "debrief.interpersonal",
      "speaker": "wren_halden",
      "text": "Maris Quell. Not a metric. Still: trust, suspicion, whether she experienced you as a person or a briefing that learned posture. Also Taly, Pim, the trail of dignity you left like coat-check tickets.",
      "tags": [
        "debrief",
        "interpersonal"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "debrief.inter.genuine",
          "text": "I stopped flowcharting for ninety seconds. She noticed.",
          "intent": "honest",
          "next": "debrief.inter_soft",
          "effects": [],
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "genuine_with_maris",
              "op": "eq",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "debrief.inter.helped",
          "text": "I burned mission time to keep Taly off a fixer's ledger.",
          "intent": "honest",
          "next": "debrief.inter_ideal",
          "effects": [],
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "helped_taly",
              "op": "eq",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "debrief.inter.cold",
          "text": "I prioritized the ask. Relationships are downstream.",
          "intent": "cold",
          "next": "debrief.inter_cold",
          "effects": [],
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "abandoned_taly",
              "op": "eq",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "debrief.inter.default",
          "text": "I was awkward, occasionally real, frequently wrong.",
          "intent": "honest",
          "next": "debrief.inter_soft",
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "next": null,
      "faculty_interjections": [
        {
          "faculty": "Empathy",
          "text": "Say the human part without translating it into cover language.",
          "weight": 1
        },
        {
          "faculty": "Idealism",
          "text": "If you helped, say so. Make her write it down.",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "debrief.intro",
      "speaker": "wren_halden",
      "text": "Sit. Same chair. Still not a metaphor. Report professional outcomes first. Interpersonal second. I will grade them on separate rubrics so your dignity has somewhere to hide.",
      "tags": [
        "entry",
        "debrief"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "debrief_started",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "debrief.intro.go",
          "text": "Professional first.",
          "intent": "professional",
          "next": "debrief.professional",
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "next": null,
      "faculty_interjections": [
        {
          "faculty": "Insecurity",
          "text": "Separate rubrics. She invented a new way to fail.",
          "weight": 1
        },
        {
          "faculty": "Composure",
          "text": "Facts. Then feelings filed as facts.",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "debrief.professional",
      "speaker": "wren_halden",
      "text": "Fragment status. Cover integrity. Voss identification. Speak in complete operational sentences.",
      "tags": [
        "debrief",
        "professional"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "debrief.prof.success",
          "text": "Fragment acquired. Voss tied to Friday dock window. Cover held or provisional.",
          "intent": "report",
          "next": "debrief.professional_good",
          "effects": [],
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "has_cipher_fragment",
              "op": "eq",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "debrief.prof.fail",
          "text": "Fragment lost \u2014 Sera or heat. Voss interest confirmed if overheard. Cover... varied.",
          "intent": "report",
          "next": "debrief.professional_bad",
          "effects": [],
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "has_cipher_fragment",
              "op": "neq",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "debrief.prof.burned",
          "text": "Extracted hot. Moth inked me. Fragment status uncertain.",
          "intent": "report",
          "next": "debrief.professional_burned",
          "effects": [],
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "cover_compromised",
              "op": "eq",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "next": "debrief.professional_mixed",
      "faculty_interjections": [
        {
          "faculty": "Tradecraft",
          "text": "Do not editorialize. She has editors.",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "debrief.professional_bad",
      "speaker": "wren_halden",
      "text": "Sera will be unbearable. I will be clinical. The dock window still exists; we are simply poorer. Failure is data. Expensive data. Interpersonal \u2014 speak.",
      "tags": [
        "debrief"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "debrief_prof_grade",
          "value": "poor"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "debrief.bad.next",
          "text": "There may have been... people.",
          "intent": "proceed",
          "next": "debrief.interpersonal",
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "next": null,
      "faculty_interjections": [
        {
          "faculty": "Idealism",
          "text": "Expensive data included a life that didn't get laminated.",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "debrief.professional_burned",
      "speaker": "wren_halden",
      "text": "Ink. Charming. We will retire Orth or bleach him. Either way, you cost us stationery. Proceed to interpersonal before I invent a third rubric called regret.",
      "tags": [
        "debrief",
        "comedy"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "debrief_prof_grade",
          "value": "burned"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "debrief.burned.next",
          "text": "Interpersonal. Quickly.",
          "intent": "proceed",
          "next": "debrief.interpersonal",
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "next": null,
      "faculty_interjections": [
        {
          "faculty": "Insecurity",
          "text": "She said bleach. About your cover. About you.",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "debrief.professional_good",
      "speaker": "wren_halden",
      "text": "Acceptable. The cipher will keep analysts employed and rival services annoyed. You may feel a brief warmth \u2014 that is blood sugar, not pride. Now: the human wreckage.",
      "tags": [
        "debrief"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "debrief_prof_grade",
          "value": "good"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "debrief.good.next",
          "text": "Interpersonal rubric. Fine.",
          "intent": "proceed",
          "next": "debrief.interpersonal",
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "next": null,
      "faculty_interjections": [
        {
          "faculty": "Analysis",
          "text": "Professional green. Brace for the other column.",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "debrief.professional_mixed",
      "speaker": "wren_halden",
      "text": "Mixed operational weather. I've seen worse. I've also seen better from people who smile with their whole face. Interpersonal.",
      "tags": [
        "debrief"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "debrief_prof_grade",
          "value": "mixed"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "debrief.mixed.next",
          "text": "Interpersonal.",
          "intent": "proceed",
          "next": "debrief.interpersonal",
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "next": null,
      "faculty_interjections": []
    }
  ]
}
